Finding a single CPU is near to impossible. I tried so and failed (and
believe me, I tried hard ;) And while we are at it, the fastest SPU you can
eventually find is the 266MHz variant. But even that does not perform liek
it should. The bottleneck of the AXPpci33 is the small and very slow memory
bus. This slows anything down. I also have an old Jensen here running at
