You should give milo the following (first time) boot options after the
installation:

boot sdb1:/boot/vmlinux-2.2.5-16 root=/dev/sdb1

Once you booted RedHat-6.0 you can copy, zip or move the kernel to any
name or directory you want, but remember it for the next reboot, so milo
can find it.
