Perhaps somebody is interested how I finally got my Creative Soundblaster
16 PnP to work.
I run Redhat 5.1 on a 164SX.
1st: I had to upgrade the isapnptools.xxxxxx.rpm package.
2nd: make a module (select Sound as Module, Soundblaster yes)
3rd: make modules modules_install
4th: pnpdump >/etc/isapnp.conf
5th: emacs isapnp.conf and uncomment the configuration I wanted (IRQ5,
DMA1 1,...., ACT Y!)
6th: isapnp /etc/isapnp.conf
7th: insmod sound

