Not quite likely.  If that's the main criterion for picking Linux or
not, you may be out of luck.  After all, even for the very unlikely
case that Digital which has designed their processor and compilers to
go well together (as opposed to the Alpha being tacked onto gcc as an
afterthought) and have invested quite a lot of serious work in it and
