The AS200-4/xxx is supported with up to 64MB SIMMS (true-parity, and all
the ones I've seen have tin sockets, so tin SIMMS) for a max total of 
384MB.  I know a couple folks who were able to use 128MB SIMMs in one
unit and got 768MB usable under OpenVMS.

Sorry, unless there's a problem with your particular AS200, or with the
SIMMs, I have no idea why you're getting those symptoms.

Rich Jordan




